multiple new polls showing that the indictment&nbsp;
from last week is not helping Donald Trump at all.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:23.040
Now, shortly after the indictment, about a day or&nbsp;
two later, Donald Trump got on truth social and,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.700
you know, he attacked the prosecutors as&nbsp;
he's been doing. But he also mentioned in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.360
one of those posts on true socials. My my&nbsp;
poll numbers have gone through the roof.&nbsp;&nbsp;

