been charged. So there's a 3 to 3% gap there.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:05.280
That makes no sense. So 3% of independents think,&nbsp;
oh, yeah, he totally intentionally broke the law,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:09.900
